{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"h":0.017314156862062835,"t":"Test 1","c":1,"y":0.040409762649054382,"x":0.090720461117557175,"w":0.06147293726603191},{"x":0.43097966966285411,"w":0.14386590321858722,"h":0.019659101777358967,"y":0.088280914213961337,"c":1,"t":"READING"},{"y":0.15261627895271235,"h":0.017477178722155817,"x":0.093203885634702596,"w":0.30679611206054686,"c":1,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1"},{"y":0.19331395376240657,"h":0.018895348284474811,"w":0.80970876057942709,"x":0.093203872037986357,"c":1,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading"},{"c":1,"x":0.091262136502556601,"w":0.16893203735351564,"y":0.21214953266484582,"t":"Passage 1 below.","h":0.017501630218600961},{"t":"Urban farming","y":0.25335754309991898,"h":0.030557357930691365,"c":1,"x":0.39531429084477421,"w":0.22888829549153644},{"c":1,"t":"In Paris, urban farmers are trying a soil-free approach to agriculture that uses less","h":0.018895348284474922,"y":0.30087209329710363,"w":0.79029123942057289,"x":0.11262137048388828},{"h":0.020348838259497959,"c":1,"t":"space and fewer resources. Could it help cities face the threats to our food supplies?","w":0.81165049235026043,"y":0.31831395296053921,"x":0.10097087024412019},{"y":0.35547685819030528,"w":0.8195262654622395,"c":1,"t":"On top of a striking new exhibition hall in southern Paris, the world's largest urban rooftop farm","h":0.020773850200332178,"x":0.091209119987867196},{"t":"has started to bear fruit. Strawberries that are small, intensely flavoured and resplendently red","y":0.37632398781334864,"w":0.79611648559570314,"c":1,"x":0.091262145454575533,"h":0.016199376947040545},{"h":0.020605485387308886,"x":0.089260724377849099,"y":0.39292279165430388,"w":0.7826497904459635,"t":"sprout abundantly from large plastic tubes. Peer inside and you see the tubes are completely","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"hollow, the roots of dozens of strawberry plants dangling down inside them. From identical","h":0.020702621127214771,"x":0.089266580051467301,"w":0.78070592244466153,"y":0.41108886025100377},{"c":1,"t":"vertical tubes nearby burst row upon row of lettuces; near those are aromatic herbs, such as basil,","y":0.43168604678397493,"x":0.091262144790288269,"h":0.0188953482844747,"w":0.8271844482421874},{"h":0.0188953482844747,"w":0.8271844482421874,"t":"sage and peppermint. Opposite, in narrow, horizontal trays packed not with soil but with coconut","c":1,"y":0.44912790706415806,"x":0.089320394442013076},{"c":1,"t":"fibre, grow cherry tomatoes, shiny aubergines and brightly coloured chards.","y":0.46622061392424408,"h":0.022381161603600819,"x":0.089220020830343708,"w":0.64677708943684886},{"x":0.091211472154164808,"y":0.50554513884838326,"w":0.79815958658854169,"h":0.019420376596421041,"c":1,"t":"Pascal Hardy, an engineer and sustainable development consultant, began experimenting with"},{"y":0.52461059185191072,"w":0.79417475382486968,"h":0.017540571028569762,"t":"vertical farming and aeroponic growing towers - as the soil-free plastic tubes are known - on","x":0.091262137930375978,"c":1},{"t":"his Paris apartment block roof five years ago. The urban rooftop space above the exhibition hall","y":0.54360465104914024,"h":0.017454538909817074,"c":1,"x":0.089320400643678119,"w":0.81553395589192712},{"w":0.79029123942057278,"x":0.089320399610101908,"c":1,"t":"is somewhat bigger: 14,000 square metres and almost exactly the size of a couple of football","y":0.56249999988729982,"h":0.017562305295950154},{"c":1,"x":0.09126215021689793,"t":"pitches. Already, the team of young urban farmers who tend it have picked, in one day, 3,000","y":0.57994186050529173,"w":0.79029123942057278,"h":0.0188953482844747},{"c":1,"x":0.089259063287803433,"t":"lettuces and 150 punnets of strawberries. When the remaining two thirds of the vast open area","y":0.59763572222199379,"h":0.020484380038727767,"w":0.8001190694173177},{"x":0.091204287351176555,"y":0.61747658604578637,"w":0.79624130249023428,"t":"are in production, 20 staff will harvest up to 1,000 kg of perhaps 35 different varieties of fruit","h":0.020244655430874059,"c":1},{"h":0.021698815651771786,"t":"and vegetables, every day.iWe're not ever, obviously, going to feed the whole city this way,'","x":0.091192826851744443,"y":0.63514719981304779,"w":0.79045822143554689,"c":1},{"h":0.019003115264797477,"x":0.091262147944939712,"c":1,"w":0.75922327677408852,"t":"cautions Hardy. 'In the urban environment you're working with very significant practical","y":0.65545171328213014},{"x":0.091189330399846821,"t":"constraints, clearly, on what you can do and where. But if enough unused space can be developed","y":0.67301224021182471,"w":0.82928268432617203,"h":0.020801822270188342,"c":1},{"h":0.021353926614066099,"c":1,"t":"like this, there's no reason why you shouldn't eventually target maybe between 5% and 10%","x":0.091187235028441199,"y":0.69111137972614956,"w":0.78851353963216153},{"y":0.71120528841150987,"h":0.019040129117876559,"w":0.14989527384440107,"c":1,"t":"of consumption.'","x":0.091113011590482879},{"t":"Perhaps most significantly, however, this is a real-life showcase for the work of Hardy's","y":0.74701567162542626,"h":0.021348476707006903,"c":1,"x":0.091179049932114828,"w":0.74968673706054689},{"w":0.80388351440429684,"h":0.01904748934451661,"c":1,"t":"flourishing urban agriculture consultancy, Agripolis, which is currently fielding enquiries from","x":0.091262126219866485,"y":0.76728971967837434},{"y":0.78425904838058702,"w":0.76519327799479187,"x":0.091185880624334359,"h":0.020315716942522766,"c":1,"t":"around the world to design, build and equip a new breed of soil-free inner-city farm.iThe"},{"c":1,"w":0.80388351440429684,"y":0.80373831754614178,"x":0.091262126240577376,"t":"method's advantages are many,' he says. 'First, I don't much like the fact that most of the fruit","h":0.019003115264797477},{"y":0.82398753907668654,"x":0.091262142739123531,"t":"and vegetables we eat have been treated with something like 17 different pesticides, or that","h":0.01758222847341373,"c":1,"w":0.77669901529947927},{"h":0.01903209448603449,"x":0.091262139271585649,"t":"the intensive farming techniques that produced them are such huge generators of greenhouse","y":0.84143302151387278,"c":1,"w":0.78834950764973966},{"w":0.025242718060811353,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"y":0.95784883707188639,"t":"16","x":0.091262136026228624}]}